:: Mer Pier
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer_pier">><<set $bus to "merPier">>
<<run rollIfBaitShopRequestsFishToday()>>
A long pier stretches out over the sea, its salt-bleached planks worn smooth by foot traffic. Waves roll below, visible through the gaps between the boards. A small shack with the word "Bait" hung over the door sits near the end of the walkway.
<br><br>

<<if $daily?.fishing?.fishingPier?.whitney?.phase is "idle">>
	<<if ["dusk", "night"].includes(Weather.dayState)>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.fishingPier.whitney.phase to "finished">>
	<<elseif Weather.precipitation is "rain">>
		Whitney and <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends are huddled against the rain underneath the pavilion at the end of the pier, cans in hand, fishing rods hanging over the edge.
		<br><br>
	<<else>>
		Whitney and <<nnpc_his "Whitney">> friends are spread along the railing further down, cans in hand, fishing rods hanging over the edge.
		<br><br>
	<</if>>
<</if>>

<<if canStartFishing()>>
	<<if !$fishing.locationsFound.includes("fishingPier")>>
		<<run V.fishing.locationsFound.pushUnique("fishingPier")>>
		<span class="gold">Looks like this could be a good spot for fishing</span>.
		<br>
	<</if>>
	<<fishingRodIcon>><<link [[Start fishing|Fishing Pier Wait]]>><<set $fishingAmbientOverride to "castOut">><</link>>
	<br>
<<elseif !$fishing.locationsFound.includes("fishingPier")>>
	<<run V.fishing.locationsFound.pushUnique("fishingPier")>>
	<span class="gold">If you had a fishing rod, you could probably catch fish from here</span>.
	<br>
<</if>>
<<if baitShopOpen()>>
	<<if $daily.fishing.baitShopRequest === "willRequest" and $fishing.baitShopIntro is "fullIntro">>
		<<baitShopIcon>><<link [[Bait Shop|Bait Shop Request]]>><</link>>
	<<else>>
		<<baitShopIcon>><<link [[Bait Shop|Bait Shop]]>>
			<<set $showPcEnterBaitShopText to true>>
		<</link>>
	<</if>>
<<else>>
	<<baitShopIcon>><<link [[Bait Shop|Bait Shop Lock]]>><</link>>
<</if>>
<br>
<<mericon>><<link [[Leave|Mer Street]]>><</link>>
